      "detail": "Description changed (see changes.json for full before/after)",
      "field": "description",
      "before": "Elevate your wardrobe with this stunning three-piece ensemble featuring premium fabrics and intricate craftsmanship. The front showcases delicate embroidery on soft lawn, while the back and sleeves are rendered in rich dyed lawn for a sophisticated contrast. An embroidered organza shirt border frames the neckline with elegance, complemented by an embroidered organza front border for added dimension.\n\nThe digital printed blended dupatta brings contemporary flair with its artistic design, finished with an embroidered organza border that echoes the shirt's detailing. A charming embroidered organza motif adorns the shirt for a refined touch. Complete the look with comfortable dyed cotton trousers that balance the ornate upper pieces.\n\nPerfect for celebrations, gatherings, or everyday elegance, this ensemble combines traditional embroidery with modern design sensibilities.",
      "after": "<p>Complete your look with the EMBROIDERED LAWN UF-4212, featuring a detailed embroidered lawn front paired with a dyed lawn back and sleeves. Organza borders and motifs add refined accents, while the digital printed Monar dupatta brings an eye-catching finish. Dyed cotton trousers complete this coordinated ensemble.<br><br></p>"
